    "body": "## Dataset\r\n\r\nOpenStreetMap extract for Southeast Brazil, distributed by Geofabrik.\r\n\r\nOptional input for the São Paulo Transit Desert Mapper project,\r\nsupporting the construction of a pedestrian network for walking-distance\r\nanalysis.\r\n\r\n## Asset\r\n\r\n- Filename: `sudeste-261108.osm.pbf`\r\n- Format: OpenStreetMap PBF\r\n- Coverage: Southeast Brazil; not limited to São Paulo municipality\r\n- Original data: OpenStreetMap contributors\r\n- Extract distributor: Geofabrik\r\n- Source: https://download.geofabrik.de/south-america/brazil/sudeste.html\r\n\r\n## Temporal reference\r\n\r\nSnapshot date indicated by the filename: 2026-11-08.\r\n\r\nThe timestamp recorded during acquisition was `2026-11-08T21:21:00Z`.\r\nConfirm it against the attached file before treating it as verified.\r\nThe data reference date is separate from the download and publication dates.\r\n\r\n## Local destination\r\n\r\n`data/raw/osm/sudeste-261108.osm.pbf`\r\n\r\nPreserve the original file unchanged. It does not need to be repackaged as ZIP.\r\n\r\n## Intended use\r\n\r\nExtract the São Paulo study area and build a suitable pedestrian network.\r\nThe regional PBF is not a ready-to-use walking graph.\r\n\r\nDocument access restrictions, connectivity, study-area boundaries,\r\nand processing decisions. Do not confuse straight-line distance with\r\nwalking-network distance.\r\n\r\n## Validation status\r\n\r\nFile integrity, internal timestamp, and contents still require verification.\r\nPublication of this asset does not imply validation.\r\n\r\n## License and attribution\r\n\r\n© OpenStreetMap contributors.\r\nOpenStreetMap data is available under the Open Database License (ODbL).\r\n\r\n- https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\r\n- https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/\r\n- https://download.geofabrik.de/\r\n\r\nThe project's software license does not replace the dataset's license."
