    "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Mindful-AI-Research/4-project-ai-ml-geospatial-transit-desert-mapper/tarball/data-artesp-2026-11-09",
    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Mindful-AI-Research/4-project-ai-ml-geospatial-transit-desert-mapper/zipball/data-artesp-2026-11-09",
    "body": "## Dataset\r\n\r\nMetropolitan bus GTFS published through the ARTESP Open Data Portal,\r\nprovided here as an input dataset for the São Paulo Transit Desert Mapper project.\r\n\r\n## Asset\r\n\r\n- File: `artesp_gtfs.zip`\r\n- Provider: ARTESP\r\n- Source: https://dadosabertos.artesp.sp.gov.br/dataset/gtfs\r\n- Selected source resource: GTFS-ARTESP, labeled “Atualizado até 09/11/2026”\r\n- Geographic scope: metropolitan regions covered by the source feed;\r\n  not limited to São Paulo municipality.\r\n\r\n## Intended use\r\n\r\nComplement SPTrans municipal bus data when evaluating scheduled\r\npublic-transport access in the São Paulo metropolitan study area.\r\n\r\nAfter downloading, place the file at:\r\n\r\n`data/raw/artesp/artesp_gtfs.zip`\r\n\r\nPreserve the ZIP and extract working copies separately.\r\n\r\n## Known source limitations\r\n\r\nThe source page reports:\r\n\r\n- Weekday/Saturday/Sunday calendar patterns without holiday exceptions.\r\n- Interpolated stop times based on available travel-time information.\r\n- Unpopulated `shape_dist_traveled`.\r\n- Some trips may lack corresponding `stop_times.txt` records.\r\n\r\nGTFS represents scheduled service, not observed vehicle operation.\r\n\r\n## Validation status\r\n\r\nPublication of this asset does not establish that its contents have\r\nbeen validated. Inspect archive integrity, tables, geographic coverage,\r\nservice dates, and missing stop-time records before analysis.\r\n\r\n## Attribution and licensing\r\n\r\nOriginal data provider: ARTESP.\r\n\r\nThis release does not relicense the dataset. Consult the original\r\nprovider's terms and confirm redistribution permissions before publication."
